ing with dementia and their companions.&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/ITHOTN-Feature-Image-1240-x-826.png\",\"url\":\"https://stanleyarts.org/event/in-the-heat-of-the-night/\",\"eventAttendanceMode\":\"https://schema.org/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\",\"eventStatus\":\"https://schema.org/EventScheduled\",\"startDate\":\"2027-03-15T13:00:00+00:00\",\"endDate\":\"2027-03-15T15:00:00+00:00\",\"location\":{\"@type\":\"Place\",\"name\":\"Stanley Hall\",\"description\":\"&lt;p&gt;The stunning Art Nouveau Stanley Hall can seat up to 180 guests at tables for [&hellip;]&lt;/p&gt;\\\\n\",\"image\":\"https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/stanley-hall-wedding-feat.png\",\"url\":\"https://stanleyarts.org/venue/stanley-hall/\",\"address\":{\"@type\":\"PostalAddress\"},\"telephone\":\"\",\"sameAs\":\"\"},\"performer\":\"Organization\"}]\r\n</script>\n\t\t<script data-js=\"tribe-events-view-data\" type=\"application/json\">\n\t{\"slug\":\"list\",\"prev_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stanleyarts.org\\/events\\/list\\/?hide_subsequent_recurrences=1&tribe_eventcategory%5B0%5D=240&eventDisplay=past\",\"next_url\":\"\",\"view_class\":\"Tribe\\\\Events\\\\Views\\\\V2\\\\Views\\\\List_View\",\"view_slug\":\"list\",\"view_label\":\"List\",\"title\":\"Events Archive - Stanley Arts London\",\"events\":[10013639,10013640,10013641],\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/stanleyarts.org\\/events\\/list\\/?tribe_eventcategory%5B0%5D=240&hide_subsequent_recurrences=1\",\"url_event_date\":false,\"bar\":{\"keyword\":\"\",\"date\":\"\",\"hide_recurring\":true},\"today\":\"2026-07-11 00:00:00\",\"now\":\"2026-07-11 18:37:14\",\"home_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stanleyarts.org\",\"rest_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stanleyarts.org\\/wp-json\\/tribe\\/views\\/v2\\/html\",\"rest_method\":\"GET\",\"rest_nonce\":\"\",\"should_manage_url\":true,\"today_url\":\"https:\\/\\/stanleyarts.org\\/events\\/list\\/?hide_subsequent_recurrences=1&tribe_eventcategory%5B0%5D=240\",\"today_title\":\"Click