events-calendar-list__event-title-link tribe-common-anchor-thin\"\n\t>\n\t\tStanley&#8217;s Film Club presents Springsteen: Deliver me From Nowhere\t</a>\n</h4>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime-wrapper tribe-common-b2\">\n\n\t\n\t<time class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-datetime\" datetime=\"2026-07-13\">\n\t\tMonday <span class=\"tribe-event-date-start\">Jul 13, 1:00 pm</span> till <span class=\"tribe-event-time\">3:00 pm</span>\t</time>\n\n\t\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</header>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-description tribe-common-b2 tribe-common-a11y-hidden\">\n\t<p>Dementia Friendly Screening of  “Springsteen: Deliver Me from Nowhere” which chronicles the making of Bruce Springsteen’s 1982 “Nebraska” album. </p>\n</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"tribe-events-read-more-wrapper\">\n\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://stanleyarts.org/event/springsteen-deliver-me-from-nowhere/\" class=\"tribe-events-read-more square-button\">\n\t\t\t\tMore info\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"col-5_sm-8_xs-16 img-zoom\">\n\t<a\n\t\thref=\"https://stanleyarts.org/event/springsteen-deliver-me-from-nowhere/\"\n\t\ttitle=\"Stanley&#8217;s Film Club presents Springsteen: Deliver me From Nowhere\"\n\t\trel=\"bookmark\"\n\t\tclass=\"tribe-events-calendar-list__event-featured-image-link img-zoom\"\n\t\ttabindex=\"-1\"\n\t>\n\t\t<img\n\t\t\tsrc=\"https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-design-3.png\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tsrcset=\"https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-design-3-300x200.png 300w, https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-design-3-1024x682.png 1024w, https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-design-3-768x512.png 768w, https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-design-3-620x413.png 620w, https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Untitled-design-3-210x140.png 210w, https://stanleyarts.org/wp-content